    "name": "Prime World: Nova",
    "steam_appid": 3782390,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782390/extras/56ac51e5aa50b459ed95f8b92225d7a2.poster.avif?t=1755090638\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782390/extras/56ac51e5aa50b459ed95f8b92225d7a2.webm?t=1755090638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782390/extras/56ac51e5aa50b459ed95f8b92225d7a2.mp4?t=1755090638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prime World Nova</strong> \u2014 a free-to-play online RPG/MOBA with an original universe, combining thrilling tactical battles and hero development. Collect talents, build an invincible team, and prove your dominance on the battlefield!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This is a fan-made project that carefully preserves the atmosphere of the original game while opening new horizons for all fans of the universe. Forward for the Prime \u2014 show everyone who is worthy of ruling this world!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782390/extras/18d388e2a6b782d5e0de8aa556e1ee5f.avif?t=1755090638\" data-has-big width=800 height=267 /></span><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the core of <strong>Prime World Nova</strong> lies the endless struggle of lords for control over the Prime \u2014 a mysterious source of magic and technology. The Prime can alter the very nature of matter, and thus, the fate of the entire world. Whoever controls the Prime rules all!  <br>Assemble a squad of unique heroes, unlock rare talents, and use them in battles to triumph over enemies and etch your name into the history of Praia forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782390/extras/e8f4c5a85a17142d2dc3631607a92a93.avif?t=1755090638\" data-has-big width=800 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Prime World Nova</strong>, every hero is unique thanks to the talent system. It\u2019s not just about equipment \u2014 the outcome of a battle is determined by the smart selection of talents and their combinations. Unlock new abilities and tailor your tactics for each opponent.<strong>\u00a0 </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>  </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782390/extras/f1a16f33cf82a7b1d248742331526bff.avif?t=1755090638\" data-has-big width=800 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build devastating skill chains and use them in combat to catch your enemy off guard. The flexible system allows you to adapt your playstyle to any situation on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782390/extras/9afa19ded7d4fe007614ac9eb084ad0a.avif?t=1755090638\" data-has-big width=800 height=267 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show off your style! A variety of skins are available for each hero, from classic to rare collectibles. Limited-edition skins appear during holidays and major events, so stay tuned for updates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782390/extras/c131f4d783a42388baf1e55477115975.avif?t=1755090638\" data-has-big width=800 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the heart of the game is the clash of great lords, who repeatedly send their heroes into battle for control of the Prime. This is an endless war for power, where every battle can change the course of history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782390/extras/52bb0955a98fce04f60db1aa634bbd9e.avif?t=1755090638\" data-has-big width=800 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your heroes right in battle sessions, choosing from a variety of upgrade paths. The diversity of talents and mini-games makes every progression unique and engaging. Experiment and find the best strategies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782390/extras/56ac51e5aa50b459ed95f8b92225d7a2.poster.avif?t=1755090638\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782390/extras/56ac51e5aa50b459ed95f8b92225d7a2.webm?t=1755090638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782390/extras/56ac51e5aa50b459ed95f8b92225d7a2.mp4?t=1755090638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prime World Nova</strong> \u2014 a free-to-play online RPG/MOBA with an original universe, combining thrilling tactical battles and hero development. Collect talents, build an invincible team, and prove your dominance on the battlefield!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This is a fan-made project that carefully preserves the atmosphere of the original game while opening new horizons for all fans of the universe. Forward for the Prime \u2014 show everyone who is worthy of ruling this world!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782390/extras/18d388e2a6b782d5e0de8aa556e1ee5f.avif?t=1755090638\" data-has-big width=800 height=267 /></span><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the core of <strong>Prime World Nova</strong> lies the endless struggle of lords for control over the Prime \u2014 a mysterious source of magic and technology. The Prime can alter the very nature of matter, and thus, the fate of the entire world. Whoever controls the Prime rules all!  <br>Assemble a squad of unique heroes, unlock rare talents, and use them in battles to triumph over enemies and etch your name into the history of Praia forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782390/extras/e8f4c5a85a17142d2dc3631607a92a93.avif?t=1755090638\" data-has-big width=800 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Prime World Nova</strong>, every hero is unique thanks to the talent system. It\u2019s not just about equipment \u2014 the outcome of a battle is determined by the smart selection of talents and their combinations. Unlock new abilities and tailor your tactics for each opponent.<strong>\u00a0 </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>  </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782390/extras/f1a16f33cf82a7b1d248742331526bff.avif?t=1755090638\" data-has-big width=800 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build devastating skill chains and use them in combat to catch your enemy off guard. The flexible system allows you to adapt your playstyle to any situation on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782390/extras/9afa19ded7d4fe007614ac9eb084ad0a.avif?t=1755090638\" data-has-big width=800 height=267 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show off your style! A variety of skins are available for each hero, from classic to rare collectibles. Limited-edition skins appear during holidays and major events, so stay tuned for updates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782390/extras/c131f4d783a42388baf1e55477115975.avif?t=1755090638\" data-has-big width=800 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the heart of the game is the clash of great lords, who repeatedly send their heroes into battle for control of the Prime. This is an endless war for power, where every battle can change the course of history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782390/extras/52bb0955a98fce04f60db1aa634bbd9e.avif?t=1755090638\" data-has-big width=800 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your heroes right in battle sessions, choosing from a variety of upgrade paths. The diversity of talents and mini-games makes every progression unique and engaging. Experiment and find the best strategies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p>",
